// HealthApp build configuration.
//
// Leave the backend values EMPTY to run in demo mode (90 days of generated data, no network).
// Put real values in Config.local.xcconfig (git-ignored), which is included at the bottom.
//
// IMPORTANT: "//" starts a comment in .xcconfig files, so write URLs as  https:/$()/your-host/stage
// e.g.  API_BASE_URL = https:/$()/abc123.execute-api.eu-west-1.amazonaws.com
//
// API_BASE_URL       API Gateway HTTP API base URL (the app appends /v1/...)
// COGNITO_DOMAIN     Hosted UI domain, e.g. healthapp-dev.auth.eu-west-1.amazoncognito.com (or just the prefix)
// COGNITO_CLIENT_ID  User-pool app client id (public client, no secret, PKCE)
// COGNITO_REGION     e.g. eu-west-1

API_BASE_URL =
COGNITO_DOMAIN =
COGNITO_CLIENT_ID =
COGNITO_REGION =
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =

#include? "Config.local.xcconfig"
